### status: illustrative-only
### llmOperational: false
### protectedContract: true
### referenceOnly: false
### public: false
### authRequired: true
### sessionAuthRequired: true
### tenantScopedHeadersRequired: true
### destructive: false
### requiresTenantHeaders: true
### runtimeRecordConfirmed: false
### selectorConfirmed: true
### publishedBackendConfirmed: false
### knownPublishedFailure: false
### accessMode: authenticated-session
### selectionGuidance: source-derived-ergon-chefia-contract
### note: Source-derived Ergon Showcase contract (localhost:8080), not deployed on the public Quickstart host. Filters SubstituicaoFuncao by hierarchical sector predicates (setorPai, caminhoHierarquicoPrefixo) and legal-basis audit predicate (semDocumentoLegal: true) for AUSENCIA_EVENTUAL.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@sessionCookie = replace-with-ERGONSESSION-cookie-value
@xsrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value
@orgao = 2

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ergon/substituicoes/filter
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ERGONSESSION={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
X-Tenant: {{orgao}}

< ../../payloads/hr/ergon_chefia_substituicoes_filter_auditoria.json
